message: "If you use ExoIntel-Prime in teaching, demonstrations, research communication or derivative software, please cite this repository."
title: "ExoIntel-Prime: Interactive Exoplanet Transit Photometry Laboratory"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jana
    given-names: Biswajit
repository-code: "https://github.com/Biswajit1999/exolight-transit-lab"
url: "https://biswajit1999.github.io/exolight-transit-lab/"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-20"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - exoplanets
  - transit photometry
  - scientific visualisation
  - astronomy education
  - WebGL
  - JavaScript
abstract: >-
  ExoIntel-Prime is a browser-based exoplanet transit photometry laboratory
  combining locally cached archival light curves, a worker-computed theoretical
  transit model and an interactive WebGL star-planet visualisation. It is
  designed for scientific visualisation, education and research communication,
  not as a formal professional fitting or detection pipeline.
